{"route":"/docs/5.3/utilities/float/","version":"5.3","renderedVersion":"5.3","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Float","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Toggle floats on any element, across any breakpoint, using our responsive float utilities."},"blocks":[{"id":"overview","type":"heading","en":"Overview","level":2},{"id":"overview--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"These utility classes float an element to the left or right, or disable floating, based on the current viewport size using the <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/float\">CSS <code>float</code> property</a>. <code>!important</code> is included to avoid specificity issues. These use the same viewport breakpoints as our grid system. Please be aware float utilities have no effect on flex items."},{"id":"overview--example-1","type":"demo","key":"d82906cc119df87efbd9","height":300},{"id":"overview--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"float-start\">Float start on all viewport sizes</div><br>\n<div class=\"float-end\">Float end on all viewport sizes</div><br>\n<div class=\"float-none\">Don’t float on all viewport sizes</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"overview--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Use the <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/helpers/clearfix\">clearfix helper</a> on a parent element to clear floats."},{"id":"responsive","type":"heading","en":"Responsive","level":2},{"id":"responsive--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Responsive variations also exist for each <code>float</code> value."},{"id":"responsive--example-1","type":"demo","key":"811f2d790ebfcc39efe0","height":300},{"id":"responsive--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"float-sm-end\">Float end on viewports sized SM (small) or wider</div><br>\n<div class=\"float-md-end\">Float end on viewports sized MD (medium) or wider</div><br>\n<div class=\"float-lg-end\">Float end on viewports sized LG (large) or wider</div><br>\n<div class=\"float-xl-end\">Float end on viewports sized XL (extra large) or wider</div><br>\n<div class=\"float-xxl-end\">Float end on viewports sized XXL (extra extra large) or wider</div><br>","language":"html"},{"id":"responsive--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Here are all the support classes:"},{"id":"responsive--list-1","type":"list","tag":"ul","items":[{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"responsive--item-1","type":"item","en":"<code>.float-start</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"responsive--item-2","type":"item","en":"<code>.float-end</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"responsive--item-3","type":"item","en":"<code>.float-none</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"responsive--item-4","type":"item","en":"<code>.float-sm-start</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"responsive--item-5","type":"item","en":"<code>.float-sm-end</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"responsive--item-6","type":"item","en":"<code>.float-sm-none</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"responsive--item-7","type":"item","en":"<code>.float-md-start</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"responsive--item-8","type":"item","en":"<code>.float-md-end</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"responsive--item-9","type":"item","en":"<code>.float-md-none</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"responsive--item-10","type":"item","en":"<code>.float-lg-start</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"responsive--item-11","type":"item","en":"<code>.float-lg-end</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"responsive--item-12","type":"item","en":"<code>.float-lg-none</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"responsive--item-13","type":"item","en":"<code>.float-xl-start</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"responsive--item-14","type":"item","en":"<code>.float-xl-end</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"responsive--item-15","type":"item","en":"<code>.float-xl-none</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"responsive--item-16","type":"item","en":"<code>.float-xxl-start</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"responsive--item-17","type":"item","en":"<code>.float-xxl-end</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"responsive--item-18","type":"item","en":"<code>.float-xxl-none</code>"}]}]},{"id":"css","type":"heading","en":"CSS","level":2},{"id":"sass-utilities-api","type":"heading","en":"Sass utilities API","level":3},{"id":"sass-utilities-api--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Float utilities are declared in our utilities API in <code>scss/_utilities.scss</code>. <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/utilities/api#using-the-api\">Learn how to use the utilities API.</a>"},{"id":"sass-utilities-api--code-1","type":"code","value":"\"float\": (\n  responsive: true,\n  property: float,\n  values: (\n    start: left,\n    end: right,\n    none: none,\n  )\n),","language":"scss"}],"demos":[{"key":"d82906cc119df87efbd9","html":" <div class=\"float-start\">Float start on all viewport sizes</div><br>\n<div class=\"float-end\">Float end on all viewport sizes</div><br>\n<div class=\"float-none\">Don’t float on all viewport sizes</div> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0"},"sprite":""},{"key":"811f2d790ebfcc39efe0","html":" <div class=\"float-sm-end\">Float end on viewports sized SM (small) or wider</div><br>\n<div class=\"float-md-end\">Float end on viewports sized MD (medium) or wider</div><br>\n<div class=\"float-lg-end\">Float end on viewports sized LG (large) or wider</div><br>\n<div class=\"float-xl-end\">Float end on viewports sized XL (extra large) or wider</div><br>\n<div class=\"float-xxl-end\">Float end on viewports sized XXL (extra extra large) or wider</div><br> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0"},"sprite":""}],"nav":[{"en":"Introduction","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/introduction"},{"en":"Download","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/download"},{"en":"Contents","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/contents"},{"en":"Browsers & devices","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/browsers-devices"},{"en":